    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 136 O’Rourke Park, a superbly presented three-bedroom semi-detached family home (86 Sq.M) with garage to side occupying a prime position within one of Sallynoggin’s most established and desirable residential neighbourhoods. This attractive property enjoys an exceptionally large front garden, offering excellent kerb appeal, generous driveway and off-street parking potential, and scope for further landscaping.\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained throughout, this inviting home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation designed for comfortable everyday living. Positioned within a quiet and mature residential setting, the property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, young families, and those seeking a quality home within easy reach of every conceivable amenity.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room overlooking the front garden, a well-appointed kitchen to the rear, together with a practical utility area providing additional storage and laundry space. Upstairs there are three generously proportioned bedrooms together with a well-finished family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the standout feature is undoubtedly the impressive front garden, offering exceptional outdoor space rarely found with properties of this type. The rear garden provides a private garden setting ideal for relaxing, entertaining, or family enjoyment. There is access to the side garage from rear garden as well as from front. Ideal for use as a garage, storage or hobby space.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Sallynoggin, the location is second to none, with an excellent choice of schools, neighbourhood shops, cafés, parks, sporting facilities and public transport all within walking distance. The nearby DART at Glenageary and excellent Dublin Bus services provide easy access to the city centre, while Dun Laoghaire, Monkstown, Blackrock and the M50 are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in a mature, quiet and exceptionally convenient location where demand continues to remain exceptionally strong.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hall leading to living accommodation and with staircase to first floor.\r\nLiving Room\r\nA spacious and light-filled reception room overlooking the generous front garden, providing an ideal space for family living and entertaining.\r\nKitchen / Dining Area\r\nWell-appointed recently modernised kitchen positioned to the rear with excellent storage and worktop space.\r\nUtility Area\r\nUseful utility at rear porch area offering additional storage together with laundry facilities.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the front garden.\r\nBedroom 2\r\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking front aspect.\r\nBedroom 3\r\nWell-proportioned single bedroom overlooking rear garden aspect.\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTastefully appointed main bathroom serving the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n•\tBeautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached home (86 sq.m) with garage to side\r\n•\tExceptionally large front garden with excellent kerb appeal\r\n•\tBright, spacious and well-maintained accommodation throughout\r\n•\tLiving room overlooking front garden\r\n•\tModern kitchen with separate utility area\r\n•\tThree well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n•\tGarage to side ideal for storage or hobby space\r\n•\tQuiet, mature and highly regarded residential location\r\n•\tExcellent potential for future extension (subject to planning permission)\r\n•\tWalking distance to schools, shops and local amenities\r\n•\tConvenient to DART, Dublin Bus, Dun Laoghaire, Blackrock and the M50\r\n•\tIdeal family home or first-time purchase\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nO’Rourke Park is a long-established and highly desirable residential address in Sallynoggin, renowned for its mature surroundings and exceptional convenience. Residents enjoy immediate access to local shopping, schools, parks, sporting facilities and excellent transport links. Dun Laoghaire, Monkstown, Blackrock Village and the beautiful Dublin coastline are all just minutes away, making this an outstanding location for modern family living.\r\n\r\nBER Rating: E1\r\nBER Number: 100612241\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 315.32 kWh/m²/yr\r\n\r\nViewing\r\n\r\nBy appointment.\r\n\r\nContact: Sales Department 01 293 7100\r\nViewing: By prior appointment.\r\n______________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nPlease Note:\r\nMorrison Estates & Lettings Limited for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: These particulars do not form any part of any contract and are given as guidance only. Maps and plans are not to scale and measurements are approximate. Intending purchasers/renters must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of details given to them either verbally or as part of this brochure. Such information is given in good faith and is believed to be correct, however, Morrison Estates & Lettings Ltd., or their agents shall not be held liable for inaccuracies. Prices quoted are exclusive of VAT (unless otherwise stated) and all negotiations are conducted on the basis that the purchasers/lessee shall be liable for any VAT arising on the transaction. PSRA License No. 004334"
      },
